{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-1","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──……や……咲耶","trans":"──……喂……咲耶","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901035230020","name":"咲耶","text":"ぁ……すまない、眠ってしまうなんて──……","trans":"啊……抱歉，我居然睡着了──……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"いいんだいいんだ\r\n──でもほら、見てくれ","trans":"没关系没关系\n──不过你看，看看那边","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901035230030","name":"咲耶","text":"え……ここは……？","trans":"诶……这里是……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901035230040","name":"咲耶","text":"わぁ……！","trans":"哇……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"プロデューサー","text":"勝手に連れてきてごめんな\r\n一応……綺麗な景色のプレゼント","trans":"擅自把你带过来抱歉啊\n算是……漂亮景色的礼物","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}